OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant 'feels helpless' over
OL,4,Adine and dashers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDine-and-dash thefts are leaving staff
OL,7,Ffeeling "helpless", a restaurant
OL,8,Fmanager has said.
OL,10,FEmma Sadofsky, of The Brazilian
OL,11,FChurrascaria, on Hull Marina, said a
OL,12,Fgroup of five diners failed to pay a
OL,13,F#160 bill after "running away" on 10
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FNearby restaurants have also reported
OL,17,Fproblems. Liam Harm, a supervisor at
OL,18,FThe Smoke Room, in Humber Street, said
OL,19,Fhe had known families to sit outside
OL,20,Fbefore waiting for a "quiet moment" to
OL,21,Fleave without paying.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
