OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant 'feels helpless' over
OL,4,Adine and dashers
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK Hospitality, the industry body, said
OL,7,Fa third of restaurants had reported
OL,8,Fdine and dash incidents over the past
OL,9,Fyear. Humberside Police said it was
OL,10,Finvestigating a report of theft at
OL,11,FSadofsky's restaurant.
